808 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 401 0 R
/E (THE SOCIAL COMPETITIVE BALANCE)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
809 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 401 0 R
/E (The tension that runs across every question is between keeping the day genuinely competitive and keeping it social. It surfaces in how callers talk about the split format and again in what they want from sponsors. Of the 4 callers who spoke to the format, 2 valued the competitive individual round, 1 valued the afternoon scramble, and 1 valued having both in the same day. No caller argued for dropping either half.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
