/Title (McDonough Stampede Charity Classic conducted thirteen one-on-one voice interviews via the Candidly AI platform between June 28 and July 1, 2026. These interviews were designed to capture direct feedback from participants regarding their experience, potential improvements, and opportunities for growth.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1291 0 R
/Prev 2518 0 R
/Next 2724 0 R
>>
endobj
2724 0 obj
<<
/Title (The methodology employed five scripted questions, covering experience, improvements, outreach, external tournament ideas, and venue feedback, supplemented by adaptive follow-up questions to probe deeper into specific participant responses.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1291 0 R
/Prev 2723 0 R
/Next 2519 0 R
>>
endobj
2725 0 obj
<<
/Title (On overall sentiment, 11 callers described the tournament in positive terms, 2 callers were mixed, raising the food and the beverage cart against an otherwise good day, and 0 callers were negative. Each classification rests on that caller's own words.)
