2727 0 obj
<<
/Title (Organization is the tournament's strongest asset. Callers described the day as smooth end to end and named the organizers directly rather than praising logistics in the abstract, which is the kind of specific credit that is hard to manufacture. \(Caller 1, Caller 2, Caller 3, Caller 4, Caller 10\))
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2522 0 R
/Next 2855 0 R
>>
endobj
2728 0 obj
<<
/Title (The venue's people rated higher than its catering. Staff and course condition drew consistent praise while food produced the only genuine split of the engagement, making it the one venue item with a decision attached. \(Caller 2, Caller 4, Caller 6, Caller 9, Caller 11, Caller 12\))
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2522 0 R
/Prev 2856 0 R
>>
