/Title (The asks are refinements, not repairs. Every suggestion assumed the event already works and proposed to sharpen it, from an earlier date and longer notice to cart signage and a second beverage cart. Nothing raised was a complaint about the tournament's premise. \(Caller 1, Caller 2, Caller 4, Caller 5, Caller 7\))
